{
  "Areas.Plains.Description": "You stand in knee-high grass, surrounded by flat plains on all sides."
  "Areas.Plains.Discovery": "You find yourself standing in knee-high grass, surrounded by flat plains on all sides. Though the mountain, forest, and lake are all visible from here, they seem quite distant.[pg]<b>You've discovered the plains!</b>"
